{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "f5f3b22e-c9ab-8813-8ac0-b149ac66be06",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T12:14:26-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Mei Patel",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:09:47-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:09:52-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, good afternoon. My name is Mei Patel. I am calling about the storm drain on my corner. It is full, full to the top, and it is not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:05-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's no good. Okay, Ms. Patel, let me get some details. What's the address where you're seeing this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-four Memorial Boulevard. On the Easton's Beach side, not the other side of the road."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:20-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Forty-four Memorial Boulevard, Easton's Beach side. And the drain is right on the corner by your house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:28-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, on the corner, maybe ten steps from my front walk. The water is just sitting there. It is brown, with leaves and sand and I do not know what. Since the storm, it does not go down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:44-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The storm from Friday into Saturday?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:47-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that one. Two days ago it ended. Two days, and still full. Today is Monday. I think somebody should have come by now."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:10:57-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I hear you. Crews have had a lot of calls since that storm, but let's get yours in. Is the water just in the street, or is it going onto anyone's property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is moving. Slowly, but it is moving toward my neighbor's garage. The driveway goes down a little, and the water is following it. If it keeps going, it will go under the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:11:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so water heading toward the neighbor's garage. Is it at the door yet, or still a few feet away?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:11:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A few feet. Maybe, how do you say, one car length. Sorry, one moment. [pause] I am making sandwiches for tomorrow, my lunch, and I am putting them down. Please continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:11:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all, take your time. Do you know if the drain is blocked with debris on top, or does it look like it's backing up from underneath?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:11:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I cannot tell. There are leaves on the grate, yes, but the water is up over the grate also. So I think it is full from below. I do not want to go in the street and push at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:12:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, definitely don't do that. Stay on the sidewalk. So I have a storm drain full and not draining at the corner by forty-four Memorial Boulevard, with water running toward the neighbor's garage. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:12:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly right. Now, who do I call to have it checked? Is it you, or someone else? I have been waiting and I do not want to call the wrong place."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:12:44-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You called the right place. I'm putting in a work order for Public Works to send someone out and look at that drain. I'll mark it as water heading toward a garage so it's flagged."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:12:59-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. When will they come? Today? Tomorrow?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'd say within the next day or two, depending on how the list shakes out. If the water reaches that garage before then, call back right away and we'll bump it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A day or two. Okay. It is already two days, you understand. But I will wait and watch it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you? I have it as a landline."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:33-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. Four zero one, five five five, zero one eight eight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-eight-eight. Got it. And it's Mei Patel, P-A-T-E-L?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Mei Patel."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right, Ms. Patel, that's in. Anything else going on over there, other drains or flooding on the street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:13:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Only this one, the one on my corner. Down the road, I saw some puddles near the beach lot, but that is the beach, I think it is normal. Mine is the problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:14:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'll just stick with yours. Thanks for calling it in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:14:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you for your patience with me. God bless you, and may He keep you well. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T12:14:21-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, Ms. Patel. Enjoy your lunch. Bye now."
    }
  ],
